Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.29,0:00:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.29,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs18\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(136.8,53.333)}Let's find a back-alley hidden gem, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.51,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"Cool adults," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to be like that too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.97,0:00:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, we've got to know a hidden gem \Nor two down a back alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs38\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(180,80)}The next day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's all go look for one tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.57,0:00:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun is taking a while, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we give him a quick call?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where is that hidden gem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.23,0:00:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think a back alley gem even is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to find a back-alley \Nhidden gem with dowsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? \NDoesn't dowsing find anything and everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.69,0:00:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way is the station, mames?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The station?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.37,0:00:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What are you doing, mames?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking which way is next to the horse, mames.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Next to the horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you meant the kanji, mames.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(196,26.667)}{\fnFredoka\b1\fs28\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(180,80)}駅(Eki): Station
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,An inverted card appeared. \NTherefore, this is the path we should follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just look at a magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to trust a magazine or tarot cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Magazines, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, you just made an enemy of every \Ntarot-using madame nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, \N"{\i1}tarot-using madames nationwide{\i0}"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun, what are you doing? 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming, coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if we don't hurry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.31,0:01:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the Hawaii-loving madame's privately run Hawaiian café down \Nthe back alley is going to get packed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that the kind of shop you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A café driven by such high validation-seeking energy \Nisn't going to be in a back alley!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, now you've made an enemy of all \NHawaiian café owner madames.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.76,0:01:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already made enemies out of two sets of madames.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Found a friend.
